abstract: "A local Python workbench for emission decay fitting and steady-state-scaled TRES/TRANES reconstruction. It supports measured instrument-response reconvolution, tail fitting, and shared-lifetime global analysis of TCSPC and compatible uniformly sampled emission decays."
license: MIT
keywords:
  - time-resolved emission
  - photoluminescence
  - fluorescence lifetime
  - TCSPC
  - global analysis
  - TRES
  - TRANES
